@host = http://localhost:5199
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### API index
GET {{host}}/

### Health (queue + socket counters)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Start a session
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cameraType": "back",
  "trackerAlgorithm": "csrt",
  "startTime": "2026-08-27T21:27:18Z",
  "screenWidth": 1080,
  "screenHeight": 2340
}

### End a session
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/end
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endTime": "2026-08-27T21:31:02Z",
  "averageFps": 27.53,
  "isSuccessful": true
}

### History — newest first
GET {{host}}/api/sessions?page=1&perPage=20

### History — filtered
GET {{host}}/api/sessions?status=completed&trackerAlgorithm=kcf&cameraType=front&isSuccessful=false&search=TS-2026

### One session
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Frames — newest first (default)
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/frames?page=1&perPage=100

### Frames — chronological, for charts
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/frames?perPage=1000&sort=asc

### Lost / reacquired events — newest first
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/events

### Detail view analytics: path, X/Y over time, red zones
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/analytics?maxPoints=5000

### Delete a session (cascades to frames and events)
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Global overview KPIs + success/failure by tracker
GET {{host}}/api/stats/overview

### Live tracking room status
GET {{host}}/api/stats/live
